      "page": "005",
      "object_record": "https://github.com/Participatory-Image-Archives/iiif-photoalbum/blob/7e703c6de4d62c698ff286db4a42932543dbe571/albums/SGV_10A_00031/album.yml",
      "observation": "Blue 1926–1928 travel album with 40 dark grey pages, glassine protection and originally mounted gelatin silver prints. Page 005 shows five mounted prints and one lower-right physical insert in the with-insert views. Its manifest lists one associated loose positive SGV_10P_09861 recto and verso. This is a strong candidate association with standalone bytes needed for exact stock and pixel correspondence."
    },
    "SGV_10A_00050": {
      "page": "023",
      "object_record": "https://github.com/Participatory-Image-Archives/iiif-photoalbum/blob/7e703c6de4d62c698ff286db4a42932543dbe571/albums/SGV_10A_00050/album.yml",
      "observation": "1949 bound rose-pattern volume. Page 023 is empty in the base capture and has a fanned stack in the insert capture. The same physical overlapping stack was independently documented through textured interleaf. Catalog lists the rectos and versos of five loose positives SGV_10P_10624–10628. Individual print assignment and visibility of whole stock and motif need raw standalone files."
    }
